    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Fungsi Arrow",
    "descriptionContent": "Pelajari cara menggunakan arrow function dalam JavaScript",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17532,
        "title": "Operator Panah",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148720,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara membuat <strong>arrow function</strong>. Fitur ini merupakan bagian dari standar JavaScript ES6 dan digunakan untuk menulis kode yang lebih rapi dan singkat.</p><p>Mari tulis ulang fungsi di bawah ini sebagai arrow function hanya dengan satu baris kode.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerSpawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ready!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerSpawnMessage());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(spawnMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const spawnMessage = () =&gt; \"Ready!\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148721,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Arrow function adalah jenis <strong>fungsi</strong><strong>anonim</strong>, yang berarti fungsi tersebut tidak memiliki nama fungsi.</p><p>Jika kita ingin memanggil fungsi-fungsi ini, kita perlu menyimpannya di dalam variabel lalu memanggil variabel tersebut dengan tanda kurung di bagian akhir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tutorial Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getLevelTitle());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelTitle());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const levelTitle</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>, dan terakhir <code>levelTitle()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148722,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan arrow function, kita tidak memerlukan keyword <code>function</code> atau nama fungsi. Artinya, hal pertama yang kita mulai adalah tanda kurung.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getLevelTitle\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTitle = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss Level&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148723,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti pada fungsi biasa, kita bisa menambahkan parameter di dalam tanda kurung, lalu menggunakan parameter tersebut di dalam fungsi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"formatScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreLabel = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerName\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score for &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scoreLabel(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>playerName</code>, diikuti oleh <code>playerName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148724,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tepat setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka, tambahkan operator arrow <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><p>Kita menggunakan operator ini tepat sebelum blok kode atau ekspresi yang ingin dijalankan oleh fungsi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthText = \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"myfunction\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHealthTextArrow = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health: 100&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthText());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getHealthTextArrow());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sama seperti pada fungsi tradisional, kita menggunakan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> untuk memuat blok kode fungsi arrow.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPlayerStatus = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + hp;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>};</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148726,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika arrow function hanya memiliki satu pernyataan, kita bisa menghilangkan kurung kurawal dan keyword <code>return</code> untuk mendapatkan kode yang sangat singkat.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{ return &quot;Game Over&quot; }\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getGameOverText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Game Over&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Game Over\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148727,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di mana kita menambahkan operator panah <code>=&gt;</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Setelah kata kunci <code>function</code> dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka <code>{</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Setelah tanda kurung dan sebelum kurung kurawal pembuka.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148728,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa fungsi kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dalam arrow function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok tersebut berisi kodenya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini digunakan untuk memanggil fungsi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok tersebut berisi kodenya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148729,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kita bisa mempersingkat kode berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getPauseText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menghapus kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dan kata kunci <code>return</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan menghapus tanda kurung <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menghapus kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> dan kata kunci <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148730,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara kita memanggil arrow function berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getHUDText = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: 20&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>getHUDText();</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>getHUDText;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getHUDText();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148731,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi arrow function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148732,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengodekan operator panah, <code>=&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getEnemyCount = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getEnemyCount());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>=&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148733,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat fungsi tersebut mengembalikan nilai <code>400</code> dengan menulis arrow function sesingkat mungkin.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getMaxScore = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getMaxScore());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>()</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>400</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148734,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil arrow function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getStartMessage = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Press Start!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getStartMessage());\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>getStartMessage</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}